# ── Scudra site — public build-time config ───────────────────────────────
#
# The interactive experience apps (apps/blindspot, apps/witness, apps/builder)
# are deployed separately from the marketing site. Set these to their public
# URLs so the site's "Open the dossier" / "Try the experience" CTAs lead
# straight into the live interactive experiences.
#
# Until a URL is set here the CTAs fall back to the closest static surface
# (e.g. /experiences/blindspot or the recipe page), so the site keeps working
# with or without deployments.
#
# Example:
#   PUBLIC_BLINDSPOT_URL=https://blindspot.scudra.dev
#   PUBLIC_WITNESS_URL=https://witness.scudra.dev
#   PUBLIC_BUILDER_URL=https://builder.scudra.dev
#
# Scoped to the site app only — copy this file to apps/site/.env (it is
# git-ignored) or set the variables in your deploy environment.
PUBLIC_BLINDSPOT_URL=
PUBLIC_WITNESS_URL=
PUBLIC_BUILDER_URL=